// Phase 13 Plan 04 Task 2 -- derivation member of the fallible-consume
// class (D-13-09 Set A class 2, repair kind wrap_call_in_try). Per
// D-13-26.2/Pitfall 3's shallow-hop guidance, the marked `try` call is
// made directly inside the entry function itself: root-to-detection hop
// distance 0, function count 1, call-edge count 1 (the one foreign
// try_call). session_phase13_injectors.go's FallibleConsumeInjector
// strips " try" from the marked line, reproducing
// syntax.fallible_call_not_consumed. This file is the ONLY member of its
// class anyone may consult when hand-deriving the wrap_call_in_try
